member.summary:
Format of the content as lower-case file extension: .pdf, .xls (OLE compound file),
.xlsx, .xlsb, .docx, .ods, .odt or .zip (other ZIP archive);
null when the content has no known signature (text, HTML or an unknown binary format)

Set the automatic verification record of an entry. A manual verification is never replaced;
an automatic one only when method, evidence or derived properties change, so that a repeated run leaves
the snapshot valid.

Text of a Word document body: sections by heading (outline level of the paragraph or its style),
one line per paragraph and table row. Deleted text, field codes and fallback content are skipped;
headers, footers and notes are not read.

Year-weak numbers of a source quote, rated within the quote only: a quote with the relevant year (or a year
group that holds it; for a tax year the period starting in the year) or without year anchors its numbers;
a number of the quote whose closest year is another year is year-weak

Years of a text with their position, without the years of legal source references (see );
an enumeration or a range of years is one group with all its years, a tax year period one hit with its
start year
